WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:06.080
Wait until Your Majesty surrenders Xie Xuan, then he'll come by then no one can fault him.

00:06.160 --> 00:07.560
Enough.

00:09.480 --> 00:10.880
My general.

00:11.680 --> 00:15.080
If I use him I trust him.

00:17.320 --> 00:18.720
Order Zhu Yuanzhi.

00:19.400 --> 00:20.680
To rescue the emperor.

00:20.760 --> 00:22.160
Yes.

00:24.040 --> 00:29.640
The 21st year of Longwu zhu Yuanzhi led troops to rescue the emperor in less than half a month.

00:29.720 --> 00:35.440
He pierced through the western aristocratic coalition then launched a lightning strike on the southern commander's camp.

00:35.520 --> 00:40.280
Personally beheaded the rebel general the eastern route scattered like birds and beasts upon hearing the news.

00:40.360 --> 00:43.480
The great families submitted memorials begging for mercy.

00:50.000 --> 00:54.160
Zhu Yuanzhi the rebels are now pacified why aren't you wearing court robes?

00:54.240 --> 00:57.720
Wearing armor in court right this is.

01:01.680 --> 01:05.120
Well said otherwise, Minister Wang.

01:05.320 --> 01:07.720
How about going to the front to fight for me?

01:07.800 --> 01:12.067
In the court General Zhu, please be careful with your words.

01:15.520 --> 01:19.680
Don't think I don't know how you talk about me behind my back.

01:20.200 --> 01:24.880
If not for concern for Your Majesty's safety would I have rushed through the night.

01:24.960 --> 01:27.720
To save you gossiping women?

01:28.200 --> 01:29.600
You.

01:31.040 --> 01:36.120
And some of you I don't care how you fight behind the scenes.

01:36.200 --> 01:41.240
Whoever dares involve Your Majesty better think carefully.

01:45.280 --> 01:46.480
Who has such great resentment?

01:46.560 --> 01:50.080
Kowtow to Your Majesty we pay respects to Your Majesty.

01:50.840 --> 01:51.960
You've worked hard.

01:52.040 --> 01:53.120
General Zhu.

01:53.200 --> 01:56.000
Your Majesty is well I am not tired.

01:58.640 --> 02:00.040
Read.

02:04.040 --> 02:06.120
General Zhu Yuanzhi of Zhenbei.

02:06.240 --> 02:11.600
Loyalty and courage bestowed by heaven merits illustrious rescued the emperor and quelled rebellion merit surpassing all officials.

02:11.920 --> 02:17.880
Now specially promoted to Grand General envoy with credentials, bearer of the Yellow Axe Commander of all military affairs.

02:18.040 --> 02:23.200
Granted the Nine Bestowments as special honor may enter court without hurrying addressed without name may wear sword and shoes in court.

02:23.320 --> 02:25.987
Opened a ministry equal to the Three Excellencies.

02:31.360 --> 02:34.640
I kowtow in gratitude for Your Majesty's grace.

